    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_19",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The International Children's Peace Prize is awarded annually to a child who has made a significant contribution to advocating children's rights and improving the situation of vulnerable children such as orphans, child labourers and children with HIV / AIDS.",
