      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "A toddler is a child 12 to 36 months old. The toddler years are a time of great cognitive, emotional and social development. The word is derived from ``to toddle '', which means to walk unsteadily, like a child of this age.",
